  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nOnline Talks at Soldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\n\nClick on the buttons below to watch any of our previous online talks. Originally shown live with a Q&A for viewers to participate in, all of our talks are free to view and remain available to watch on demand now.\n\nPlease do consider making a donation if you watch and enjoy any of these events, as it's only with your support we can continue to tell new stories in this way. You also help support the museum and the continued care for the county's military collections, representing soldiers on the front lines to ordinary people on the home front.\n\nPast Online Talks\nAll Available Now\nSeries 1\nSeries 2\nSeries 3\nSeries 4\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
